# NetPortal Cursor Rules

Always follow AGENTS.md at the repository root as the authoritative project specification.

Core constraints:
1. Zero emojis anywhere (code, UI, SVG icons, commits, docs).
2. English Conventional Commits only (`feat(scope): ...`, `fix(scope): ...`).
3. Keep `core/` free of UI/Wails/GTK dependencies and keep `core/mobile/` gomobile-compatible.
4. Never introduce hidden default split-routing; all splits and fallbacks belong to explicit RoutingProfile rules.
5. Respect Linux Wayland & WebKitGTK 4.1 rules (`-tags webkit2_41`, `WEBKIT_DISABLE_DMABUF_RENDERER=1`, dark-mode CSS `appearance: none`, BOM-free UTF-8 nftables).
6. Read matching playbooks in `.agents/skills/<skill>/SKILL.md` before modifying engines, routing, daemon IPC, UI, or CI workflows.
